title: Authorizations › Case page › Numbers and notes
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: The three tiles, the denial banner and the two standing notes under the header. They stay on screen on all five tabs and change as actions are applied.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the numbers are seed data plus simple arithmetic.
---
screen pg "Under the header buttons\nThree tiles, banners"

group gT1 "Tile 1"
  screen t1 "'Approval chance' (or 'Chance to overturn' on a denial)\nRing counts up over about a second\n'62% → 88%'"
  process t1a "Line under it\n'if every action is applied'\nAfter applying: 'up to 88% with the rest' or 'after the agents' checks'"
  process t1b "Pill 'Moderate · likely range 57–66%'\nStrong 80+, Moderate 55–79, At risk below 55"
endgroup

group gT2 "Tile 2"
  screen t2 "'How sure are we'\nHigh, Medium or Benchmark estimate"
  decision dBm "Fewer than 100 similar cases from you and the network?"
  process t2a "'Based on 1,248 similar cases: 212 yours, 806 from the network, 230 benchmark'"
  process t2b "'Little history for this payer ... benchmark estimate'\n'Only N are yours or the network's.'"
endgroup

group gT3 "Tile 3"
  screen t3 "'Days likely granted'\n'11 of 14 days likely'"
  process t3a "'62% chance of all 14, otherwise most likely 7'"
  process t3b "On a denial: 'Days in question'\n'The payer approved part of the stay. The other days are what the call is about.'"
endgroup

decision dDn "Is it a denial?"
toast bd "Banner 'This request was denied'\n'Advocate owns the next step. The peer-to-peer brief and the appeal live in Denial Intelligence.'"
click bdo "Click 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"
goto gD "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open a denial"
toast n1 "Note: 'The approval chance estimates how well the paperwork fits this payer's past decisions. It never blocks a request and is never shown to payers or patients.'"
toast n2 "Note: 'Decision support for documentation and workflow only. It does not recommend or decide care.'"
goto gT "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Tabs and deep links"
store ap "Applying actions on the first tab moves tile 1 and tile 3 and the range\nSee Recommended actions › Apply selected"

pg --> t1 --> t1a --> t1b
pg --> t2 --> dBm
dBm -->|No| t2a
dBm -->|Yes| t2b
pg --> t3 --> t3a
t3 -.-> t3b
pg --> dDn
dDn -->|Yes| bd --> bdo --> gD
dDn -->|No| n1
bd --> n1
n1 --> n2 --> gT
t1b -.-> ap
